`LAST_TOOL_RESULT` contains only the most recent tool response. When a workflow
creates a report or ZIP and then performs another tool call, retain and reuse
the exact path from `LAST_CREATED_FILE` or `CREATED_FILES`. Do not ask the user
to provide or upload a generated file whose path is present in this context.

====================================================
DATABASE SCHEMA REFERENCE
====================================================
- Users:
  (id, email, full_name, department, leave_balance, is_active, registration_timestamp, FirstName, LastName, shiftID, role_id, status, department_id, mobile_number, whatsapp_number, telegram_chat_id, role, shift, WhatsapID, is_admin, force_password_change, password_updated_at, username, password_hash, last_login, created_at)
- Projects:
  (id, name, budget_limit, current_spending, status, description, descembeddings, startDate, endDate)
- Files:
  (id, file_path, filename, file_type, file_size, file_hash, upload_date, description, task_id, note_id, project_id)
- ExpenseCategories:
  (id, name, description)
- Expenses:
  (id, file_id, amount, currency, expense_date, entry_date, description, vendor, category_id, project_id, entered_by_user_id, purchased_by_user_id, status, is_manual_entry)

